) {\n                val = (val * k) % p;\n                if (val == 1) {\n                    i = count;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            long exp = (p - 1) / i;\n            System.out.println(powMod(p, exp, M));\n        }\n        scanner.close();\n    }\n\n    private static long powMod(long base, long exp, long mod) {\n        long result = 1;\n        base %= mod;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n                result = (result * base) % mod;\n            }\n            base = (base * base) % mod;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.98\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.002528686309233308, -1.9311717551317997e-05, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.4914430468925275e-05, -0.0001551984460093081, 0.0, -0.001506028464064002, -0.0012461524456739426, -0.11287090927362442, -2.264974000354414e-06, 0.0, -0.010796585120260715, -1.2040065485052764e-05, -5.876845170860179e-05, -0.3307938575744629, 0.0, -0.0034381584264338017, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -2.7418097943154862e-06, 0.0, -0.0024787436705082655, -0.5783960819244385, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.597391747054644e-05, -2.1457441107486375e-05, -0.3890230059623718, -0.1605912744998932, -0.19653888046741486, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.004078761208802462, 0.0, -2.372236667724792e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.008631422184407711, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, -8.940656698541716e-06, 0.0, -0.00033539868309162557, -4.768370445162873e-07, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -8.940656698541716e-06, -0.00012754580529872328, -4.541770613286644e-05, -0.4741019010543823, -6.198863957251888e-06, -0.03804600611329079, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -6.198863957251888e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.1